    question: `The time period of a simple harmonic oscillator is 𝑇 = 2 𝜋 𝑘 𝑚 . Measured value of mass ( 𝑚 ) of the object is 10 g with an accuracy of 10 mg and time for 50 oscillations of the spring is found to be 60 s using a watch of 2 s resolution. Percentage error in determination of spring constant ( 𝑘 ) is ________%.`,
