    id: 13,
    question: `In an experiment the values of two spring constants were measured as 𝑘 1 = ( 10 ± 0.2 ) N / m and 𝑘 2 = ( 20 ± 0.3 ) N / m . If these springs are connected in parallel, then the percentage error in equivalent spring constant is :`,
