    question: `The energy of a system is given as E ( t ) = 𝛼 3 e − 𝛽 𝑡 , where t is the time and     𝛽 = 0.3   s − 1 . The errors in the measurement of 𝛼 and 𝑡 are 1.2 % and 1.6 % , respectively. At     𝑡 = 5   s , maximum percentage error in the energy is :`,
