    id: 33,
    question: `The position of a particle moving on 𝑥 -axis is given by 𝑥 ( 𝑡 ) = 𝐴 sin ⁡ 𝑡 + 𝐵 cos 2 ⁡ 𝑡 + 𝐶 𝑡 2 + 𝐷 , where 𝑡 is time. The dimension of 𝐴 𝐵 𝐶 𝐷 is`,
