    id: 42,
    question: `Least count of a vernier caliper is         1 20   N   cm . The value of one division on the main scale is     1   mm . Then the number of divisions of main scale that coincide with N divisions of vernier scale is :`,
    options: [`( 2   N − 1 2   N )`, `( 2   N − 1 20   N )`, `( 2   N − 1 )`, `( 2   N − 1 2 )`],
