    id: 49,
    question: `While measuring diameter of wire using screw gauge the following readings were noted. Main scale reading is     1   mm and circular scale reading is equal to 42 divisions. Pitch of screw gauge is     1   mm and it has 100 divisions on circular scale. The diameter of the wire is     𝑥 50   mm . The value of 𝑥 is :`,
