    question: `What is the dimensional formula of 𝑎 𝑏 − 1 in the equation ( P + a V 2 ) ( V − b ) = RT , where letters have their usual meaning.`,
    options: [`[ M 6   L 7   T 4 ]`, `[ M − 1   L 5   T 3 ]`, `[ M 0   L 3   T − 2 ]`, `[ ML 2   T − 2 ]`],
