    question: `The equation of stationary wave is : .  .  𝑦 = 2 a sin ⁡ ( 2 𝜋 nt 𝜆 ) cos ⁡ ( 2 𝜋 𝑥 𝜆 ) .  Which of the following is NOT correct :`,
