    question: `Given below are two statements : Statements I : Astronomical unit (Au), Parsec (Pc) and Light year (ly) are units for measuring astronomical distances. Statements II : Au < Parsec ( Pc ) < ly In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:`,
