    question: `A physical quantity P is given as 𝑃 = 𝑎 2 𝑏 3 𝑐 𝑑 The percentage error in the measurement of a, b, c and d are 1%, 2%, 3% and 4% respectively. The percentage error in the measurement of quantity P will be`,
